t you call junk food?</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/BBC_News\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"BBC News\">BBC News</a>. 2006-11-30 <span class=\"reference-accessdate\"> &#91;<span class=\"nowrap\">2010-06-29</span>&#93;</span>. （原始內容<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191010164339/http://news.bbc.co.uk/2/hi/uk_news/magazine/6187234.stm\">存檔</a>於2019-10-10）.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E5%9E%83%E5%9C%BE%E9%A3%9F%E5%93%81&amp;rft.atitle=Is+this+what+you+call+junk+food%3F&amp;rft.aufirst=Brendon&amp;rft.aulast=O%27Neill&amp;rft.date=2006-11-30&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=BBC+News&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fnews.bbc.co.uk%2F2%2Fhi%2Fuk&#95;news%2Fmagazine%2F6187234.stm&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal\" class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-ama-who-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-ama-who_4-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFParks2016\" class=\"citation web\">Parks, Troy. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.ama-assn.org/delivering-care/population-care/who-warns-kids-digital-exposure-junk-food-ads\">WHO warns on kids' digital exposure to junk-food ads</a>. American Medical Association. 2016-12-16 <span class=\"reference-accessdate\"> &#91;<span class=\"nowrap\">2022-08-02</span>&#93;</span>. （原始內容<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20220205105947/https://www.ama-assn.org/delivering-care/population-care/who-warns-kids-digital-exposure-junk-food-ads\">存檔</a>於2022-02-05）.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E5%9E%83%E5%9C%BE%E9%A3%9F%E5%93%81&amp;rft.atitle=WHO+warns+on+kids%27+digital+exposure+to+junk-